       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is well above the maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Order as written:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Usual maximum:** 3,200 mg/day for adults under physician supervision. Single doses are typically no more than 800 mg.\n- **Risk:** This is double the maximum daily dose. It carries a serious risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg PO every 6 hours** (for pain or fever)\n- **1600 mg total per day,** divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give me the clinical rationale. I can add the rationale as a note on the order."
